  "post_content": "<p>(16 fotos) La llibreria La Repro, a l&#39;avinguda Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;, 74 d&#39;Onda, ha acollit aquest dijous la&nbsp;la presentaci&oacute; del llibre de Prado G. Vel&aacute;zquez En blanco y negro<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4G0aYlSEGBw&amp;feature=youtu.be\">watch?v=4G0aYlSEGBw&amp;feature=youtu.be</a>, una novela negra que t&eacute; com a protagonista una detectiu lesbiana als Estats Units dels anys 50.</p>\n<p>Era el primer acte de les jornades Diversitat LGTBI, organitzades per l&#39;&agrave;rea d&#39;Igualtat de l&#39;Ajuntament, com ha recordat el regidor responsable, Asensio Blaya Mart&iacute;nez.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_5597.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentat l&#39;autora la responsable del col&middot;lectiu LGTBI a Castell&oacute; i coordinadora de Cultura estatal,&nbsp;Pastora de Florencio. Ambdues han coincidit que cal naturalitzar la diversitat i qualsevol forma de relaci&oacute; sexual.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5576.jpg\" alt=\"img_5576\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5577.jpg\" alt=\"img_5577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5578.jpg\" alt=\"img_5578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5579.jpg\" alt=\"img_5579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5581.jpg\" alt=\"img_5581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5582.jpg\" alt=\"img_5582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5583.jpg\" alt=\"img_5583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5586.jpg\" alt=\"img_5586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5587.jpg\" alt=\"img_5587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5589.jpg\" alt=\"img_5589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5590.jpg\" alt=\"img_5590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5594.jpg\" alt=\"img_5594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5597.jpg\" alt=\"img_5597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5599.jpg\" alt=\"img_5599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5601.jpg\" alt=\"img_5601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actelgtbilarepro18/img_5603.jpg\" alt=\"img_5603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
